eStat
=====

Build requirements: JDK 11 or newer. Maven 3.9.16 is downloaded automatically
by the Maven Wrapper (use mvnw.cmd on Windows).

Build and run tests:

    ./mvnw clean verify

Run the application on http://localhost:9000:

    ./mvnw compile exec:java -Dplay.http.secret.key=replace-with-your-secret

The build compiles Scala sources in app/, generates Twirl templates and the
injected router from conf/routes, and packages conf/ and public/ resources.
Dependencies retain Play 2.9.7 and Scala 2.13.16. The Virtuoso JDBC and Jena
integration jars are supplied in lib/. Running requires access to the Virtuoso
database configured in conf/application.conf and a deployment-specific Play secret
key passed as shown above; tests disable that database.

The packaged application jar is target/eStat-1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar. It requires the
runtime dependencies on the classpath; it is not a standalone executable jar.
